 o dispositivi di protezione individuale possono trasformarsi rapidamente in situazioni pericolose. Imparate a riconoscere tempestivamente i pericoli e ad agire in modo sicuro.", "short_description": "Scoprite la sicurezza sul lavoro nell'edilizia in legno in modo virtuale e realistico: riconoscere i rischi tipici, reagire correttamente, senza alcun pericolo di lesioni. Imparate a evitare errori e a utilizzare in modo sicuro utensili e moduli."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "WoodConstructionCover - Querformat.png", "id": "1735425970481901", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821696_1735425973815234_7026648888461368653_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8U0qS9NjJUMQ7kNvwHrnoS_&_nc_oc=AdqO1XeutJ2C29V9DQtuwN4cOWfrnW-NC9Tw589XeqTQ8DfCKOq3DoYpIg2joMKOv2w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS6mgOXsLKJPYAZYj-QH5Ij7EEd2YcZCT0TWcQ5wmwRMA&oe=6B071663"}, {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1404469407857988", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819845_1404469411191321_2374008257608234867_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_dXrKtTHka8Q7kNvwGnqxki&_nc_oc=AdqiXDr2yzMA_eOUHD2BscXjmgbzBIcB-mHyQSuuoPUsNM7kBtonORrsX1app_k1c_s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQYu1jeuLmo8AJ5hZhr2Y_ksxw4hKPXe8TQToL1XL-djg&oe=6B07025D"}, {"file_name": "WoodConstructionCover - Hochformat.png", "id": "1138371601691473", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822307_1138371605024806_6545105809583793091_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Xj7KtnlfgCoQ7kNvwGeiSh2&_nc_oc=AdoNvF0jUU2k6owIOnf6r-SuFDUFMsOXmKQ-clCy_VW0YvZIVMkmn6P76xW7e7uD6wk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQScptUmNXXxITRQgxsKKpYP_u